[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_29000100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_29000100_02_0010","text":"──那么，各位\n路上小心～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_29000100_02_0020","text":"好的，我要上了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_29000100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_29000100_02_0030","text":"…………呵呵"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_29000100_02_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_29000100_02_0040","text":"趁大家外出的时间\n稍微收拾一下──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_29000100_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_29000100_02_0050","text":"……咦，这是──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_29000100_02_0060","text":"忘东西了～……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_29000100_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_29000100_02_0070","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_29000100_02_0080","text":"……追不上……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_29000100_02_0090","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_29000100_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_29000100_02_0100","text":"骑自行车的话，也许能追上……？"}]
